# w.lang.ro/shards/irregular: the Romanian forms no paradigm class covers: the auxiliaries and suppletive verbs (fi, avea, vrea, da, lua, veni, vedea, împărți), imperatives that are not the 3rd person (fă, du, mergi, treci), and the plurals of zi, ou, om and the forms of nou.
